+-- lab_unlock.lua (development only; ISAAC_RGON_LAB=lab_unlock.lua, round 123): unlocks every achievement a mod defines
+-- (through the layer's own unlock, as PersistentGameData:Unlock does), once, in the main menu, so a mod's characters show
